    {
      "id": "claim_4badf2a2035f4435bde23c495dc66a6b",
      "statement": "A change is complete only when it satisfies the Definition of Done in the technical manual: acceptance criteria pass with no out-of-scope additions, focused and full tests pass with ruff check, any frontend change passes npm run build with dist/ synced, human confirmation/throttle/privacy/task mutual exclusion are not weakened, new config/commands/behavior are documented, logs and API responses do not leak sensitive data, and git diff is reviewed with no unrelated files, runtime data, or keys.",
